<title>USA: BFGoodrich completes sale of unit.</title>
<headline>BFGoodrich completes sale of unit.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Ohio 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFGoodrich Co said it has completed the sale of its aerospace engine electrical systems division to Unison Industries.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Goodrich said the business, which produces electrical equipment and wiring harnesses for aircraft and industrial turbine engines, has 578 employees and had 1996 sales of about $60 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
